{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this building puzzle platformer, <i>you</i> place the platforms and must then reach the top of your own creations. Help Bob through his career from apprentice to architect by building the tallest structure imaginable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trust me, I'm an engineer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/trust_me_small.gif?t=1750935309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engineering degree or not, with your help Bob can prevail!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/build_all_small_v3.gif?t=1750935309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level, you're faced with new challenges and can only use a finite number of objects. Twist and turn the objects to make them fit where you want and ultimately create a climbable structure that takes you to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/climb_all_small_v2.gif?t=1750935309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many different types of objects to build with and they interact with each other in different ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each level you will be able to compare your score with all who beat the level before you, can you get the top score?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3215120?t=1750935309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3215120?t=1750935309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/634cca5052845b08bdefddb74e77e3f0c83c1151/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750935309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/634cca5052845b08bdefddb74e77e3f0c83c1151/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750935309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3509810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this building puzzle platformer, <i>you</i> place the platforms and must then reach the top of your own creations. Help Bob through his career from apprentice to architect by building the tallest structure imaginable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trust me, I'm an engineer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/trust_me_small.gif?t=1750935309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engineering degree or not, with your help Bob can prevail!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/build_all_small_v3.gif?t=1750935309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level, you're faced with new challenges and can only use a finite number of objects. Twist and turn the objects to make them fit where you want and ultimately create a climbable structure that takes you to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/climb_all_small_v2.gif?t=1750935309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many different types of objects to build with and they interact with each other in different ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each level you will be able to compare your score with all who beat the level before you, can you get the top score?</p>","developers":["Alexander Lahti","Suumpmolk","The LoFi Boi","Mr_Musicguy"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/a612929b78d28539dac27793a4612d67db16db75/header.jpg?t=1750935309","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099079,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099079/movie480.mp4?t=1740338874","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099079/movie_max.mp4?t=1740338874"},"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099079/b9aa02db46e1c723e3d7936969589717f31abafe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740338874","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099079/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740338874","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099079/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740338874"}}],"name":"Blueprint Bob","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requir